Main project design:
          experiments
                ↓
          registry (router)
      ↓        ↓         ↓
  models   prompts   datasets


Due to token limitation, the project will be parted into 3 phases to reduce cost:

Phase 1 — Pilot
    20 samples
    3 ratios
    ~8k tokens
Use this to:
    debug parsing
    fix prompts
    check verifier behavior

Phase 2 — Core experiment
    300 samples
    5 ratios
    -> your main results

Phase 3 — Extension
    add second model
    or adversarial generator
